Did you join the boxes to make a box with 2 holes?

Did you give the box with 2 holes to the robot that wants a box
like that?

Did you give the box with 3 holes to the robot that has a box
like that in his thought bubble?

Did you get up, walk outside, and wait 8 seconds after starting up both robots?

Did you take out the number from the box with with 2 holes?

Well I would give the box with 2 holes to the robot that was
trained to work on boxes with 2 holes.  And I give the other
box to the other robot.  Then I'd stand up, go out the door,
wait 8 seconds, come back in, and sit down.
Then I'd take out the number in the second hole
of the box with only 2 holes.

